        "collapsible_tab_Qz7EyW": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why Shilajit Tablets?",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>The cleanest way to take shilajit daily.</strong></p><p>Resin requires measuring. Liquid requires a dropper. Tablets require nothing — two, a glass of water, done.</p><p>But convenience is not why we made them. We made them because the tablet format demands the most from sourcing and compression — and we wanted to show what that looks like when both are done right.</p><ul><li>Precise 500mg per serving. No measuring, no guessing.</li><li>Travel-ready. No jar, no spoon, no mess.</li><li>Same amount, every tablet, every batch.</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nXt8Qr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "One ingredient. That's the point.",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Pure shilajit extract does not compress easily. Without anything added to help it hold shape, the compression process has to work harder — and the sourcing has to be right from the start.</p><p>We solved the compression problem without adding anything. What holds this tablet together is the extract itself.</p><p><strong>The result:</strong> Dibenzo-α-pyrones intact. 521.59mg per serving, confirmed by Certified Laboratories. 85+ trace minerals naturally present. No compound introduced. No compound lost.</p><p><strong>85+ Trace Minerals</strong> — naturally present, not added</p><p><strong>Dibenzo-α-Pyrones</strong> — intact in every tablet</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_krM7aT": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's in it. What isn't.",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Active ingredients:</strong> Each serving contains 500mg of pure Himalayan shilajit extract across two tablets — carrying Dibenzo-α-pyrones naturally present, and 85+ trace minerals naturally occurring.</p><p><strong>Other ingredients:</strong> none.</p><p>Every batch tested by Certified Laboratories under ISO/IEC 17025.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_HphhfY": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Two tablets. No measuring. No mess.",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Take 2 tablets daily with water. Morning, on an empty stomach, is best — it gives fulvic acid the clearest path before food slows things down.</p><p>Do not exceed 2 tablets per day. Consistency matters more than quantity.</p><p>Consult a doctor before use if pregnant, nursing, or on medication. Keep out of reach of children. Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_TgW7KD": {
