    "lab_tested_quality_t3NkKm": {
      "type": "lab-tested-quality",
      "name": "Lab Tested Quality",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "The Batch Reports. Right Here.",
        "description": "<p>Three independent tests. One batch. Every number on record.<br/>Himalayan shilajit tablets are only as good as what the lab finds inside them. Ours were tested for fulvic acid content, heavy metal presence, and microbial purity — separately, by Certified Laboratories, accredited to ISO/IEC 17025:2017. Not a single combined report. Three individual tests, each covering a different category of purity.<br/><br/></p>",
