      "name": "FAQ",
      "settings": {
        "show_schema": false,
        "heading": "Pure Shilajit Tablets. This Is What's In Them.",
        "description": "<p>\nPure shilajit resin, dried slowly and pressed into a 250mg tablet. No binders added to hold the shape. No fillers added to reach the weight. The compression process works harder so the ingredient list doesn't have to grow.\n</p>\n<p>\nWhat survives that process intact is what matters.\n</p>\n<p>\nFulvic acid — 521.59mg per serving, verified by Certified Laboratories. 85+ trace minerals, naturally carried from the raw resin into every tablet. Dibenzo-α-Pyrones, the compounds authentic shilajit carries — preserved in every tablet. Nothing introduced. Nothing lost.\n</p>\n<p>\nAll of it from one place. Nepal's Everest region, above 18,000 ft. Hand-collected by licensed Sherpa collectors. The same source, the same altitude, the same standard — batch after batch.\n</p>",
        "content_alignment": "Left",
