    "slider_with_banner_GLDwpC": {
      "type": "slider-with-banner",
      "blocks": {
        "slide_fFdGcG": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 1 - 2",
            "slide_heading": "The Beginning",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nFulvic acid and 85+ trace minerals are being introduced to the system for the first time. Pure shilajit tablets make this consistent — same dose, same time, every day. No measuring, no variation, no guesswork about whether today's amount matched yesterday's.</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nSome people notice a shift in how their mornings feel during this window. Others don't notice anything yet. Both are normal. The compounds are present. The process has started.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_VUR3wa": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 3 - 10",
            "slide_heading": "Where Most People Notice",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nBy this point, the fulvic acid and Dibenzo-α-Pyrones in these Himalayan shilajit tablets have been part of a daily routine long enough to accumulate. The 85+ trace minerals have been introduced to the system consistently, same amount, every single day.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nThis is the period most customers reach out to us. Reports during this stretch tend to mention recovery and focus. Two pure Himalayan shilajit tablets, taken daily, have had enough time to build into something the body recognizes.\n</p>\n</div>"
          }
        },
        "slide_8E6BHW": {
          "type": "slide",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Weeks 11+",
            "slide_heading": "When It Becomes Routine",
            "slide_text": "<div class=\"h-max flex flex-col justify-center\">\n<p>\nAt this point, the compounds in these purest shilajit dry drops have been building consistently for over two months. Fulvic acid, trace minerals, Dibenzo-α-Pyrones — all delivered in the same precise dose, every single day.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"text-grey\">\nMost people at this stage stop thinking about it. The two tablets are part of the morning. The routine just works.\n</p>\n<p><em>\nIndividual experiences vary. These are general observations shared by customers, not guaranteed outcomes. For best results, take daily without skipping.\n</em></p>\n</div>"
          }
        }
      },
